<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GSSO_000484> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A state of being related to an organism's health." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GSSO_000484> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
